008',0,'','This project was earlier registered on 11.10.2017 which was valid up to 30.06.2018 for the development of 89 residential plots. The promoter of this project in its application has sought 1 year extension up to 30.06.2019. PUDA vide its letter dated 29.05.2020 has given extension for completion of the Mega Project upto 31.12.2022 of which this project is also a part. Further the promoter vide its letter dated 27.01.2020 has intimated that the development work was completed within the validity period however there was delay on the part of GMADA to issue partial completion certificate which ultimately was issued on 12.09.2018 and accordingly has requested that the extension in the validity of registration may be approved upto 12.09.2018. The evaluation team has examined the application under section 6 of the RERA Act and do not find any non-compliance/observation and therefore has forwarded the request of the promoter for extension in the validity of the project. Even though in the application the promoter has applied for extension in the registration from 30.06.2018 to 30.06.2019 it is recommended that the extension in the validity of the registration be granted up to 12.09.2018 in terms of the company own request dated 27.01.2020 made to the authority. ',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:37:55.000','mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:37:55.000'),(1801,150007,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:41:55.000',1251,10282,'','FormE2021SAS0021','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-06-22 11:41:53.993','','2021-06-22 11:41:53.993',0,'','The applicant/Promoter may comply and provide the necessary documents/details as per the observations raised in the checklist',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:41:55.000','mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:41:55.000'),(1802,150007,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:42:25.000',1704,10888,'','FormE2021SAS0019','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-06-22 11:42:24.118','','2021-06-22 11:42:24.118',0,'','The applicant/Promoter may comply and provide the necessary documents/details as per the observations raised in the checklist',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:42:25.000','mngradminrera','2021-06-22 11:42:25.000'),(1803,150026,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 12:01:56.000',1908,11086,'','FormE2021PTL0001','','','Authority Desk','Application Return Back to Evaluation Team','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-06-22 12:01:55.446','','2021-06-22 12:01:55.446',0,'','In this case the original registration is valid up to  31.03.2020 and the promoter has sought extension in the validity of registration up to 31.03.2022. This is a case which falls under the category where six months extension has already been granted including in this case in terms of authority circular dt. 28.10.2020 on account of the Covid 19 calamity. As already decided in other case please take a confirmation from the promoter weather it needs 1 year extension inclusive of six months already granted to it or it needs extension of 1 year or any other period not exceeding 1 year in addition to six months already granted and such request should be backed by justified reasons.',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-06-22 12:01:56.000','mngradminrera','2021-06-22 12:01:56.000'),(1804,150006,'excgen2','2021-06-22 12:08:33.000',1908,11086,'','FormE2021PTL0001','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-06-22 12:08:31.993','','2021-06-22 12:08:31.993',0,'','Observations as per checklist. ',2,0,'excgen2','2021-06-22 12:08:33.000','excgen2','2021-06-22 12:08:33.000'),(1805,150006,'excgen2','2021-06-22 12:10:22.000',1308,10607,'','FormE2020SAS1137','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-06-22 12:10:20.618','','2021-06-22 12:10:20