Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2021-11-11 10:37:42.000','999','2021-11-11 10:37:42.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-11-11 10:37:42.000','sysadmin','2021-11-11 10:37:42.000'),(2254,150004,'999','2021-11-12 13:36:32.000',1274,10330,'999','FormE2021RPR0010','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2021-11-12 13:36:32.000','999','2021-11-12 13:36:32.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-11-12 13:36:32.000','sysadmin','2021-11-12 13:36:32.000'),(2255,150004,'999','2021-11-15 12:56:45.000',1592,10711,'999','FormE2020SAS1082','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2021-11-15 12:56:45.000','999','2021-11-15 12:56:45.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-11-15 12:56:45.000','sysadmin','2021-11-15 12:56:45.000'),(2256,150001,'999','2021-11-15 13:33:05.000',1017,10391,'999','FormE2021SAS0040','Form-E Submitted (New Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Submitted','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2021-11-15 13:33:05.000','999','2021-11-15 13:33:05.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Submitted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2021-11-15 13:33:05.000','sysadmin','2021-11-15 13:33:05.000'),(2257,150011,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:37:06.000',1218,10548,'','FormE2021BTI0015','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-11-16 11:37:06.734','','2021-11-16 11:37:06.734',0,'','This project was registered with the validity date upto 31.12.2020 with 505 residential plots, 2 Nursing Homes and 1 Primary School and accordingly after the initial validity of registration expired the registration stands further extended by six months upto 30.06.2021 in view of the Authority circular dated 18.05.2020. The promoter has now applied for extension in the validity of registration for one year i.e. upto 30.06.2022 citing reasons in the explanatory note that even though the project is complete the completion certificate has not yet been issued. Promoter has submitted license issued by Housing and Urban Development Punjab dated 03.03.1992 valid upto 02.03.1993 to the society for establishment of the Housing Complex Dabawali Bathinda. This license was to be got renewed on 02.03.1994 however renew copy of the same has not been provided. The promoter has submitted in architect certificate in Form 1 where it has given the status of whereby in terms of the Table A depicted certificate which relates to completing the task/activities is not applicable in this case as it is residential plotting and development project. However in table B as per the report the internal and external work in respect of the registered project stands completed.\r\nThe promoter in explanatory note has also stated that the work could not be completed in the initial valid period and they have applied to competent authority for granting completion certificate with respect to the project.  Further, they have submitted that renewal of license is not required as they are under process of applying for completion certificate to the Competent Authority which will take some time. ',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:37:06.000','mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:37:06.000'),(2258,150011,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:38:22.000',1218,10548,'','FormE2021BTI0015','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-11-16 11:38:22.653','','2021-11-16 11:38:22.653',0,'','In contiunation the remaining part of the summary is as under. \r\nThe Executive General 3 in his note dated 09.11.2021 while giving status of the validity of the project has also stated that quarterly updates applicable till date along with Form 5 has been uploaded and has accordingly proposed to consider the matter and approve the extension under Section 6 of the Act.\r\nEven though all the document required for granting extension under Section 6 of the Act seems to be in order however it is observed that license to develop the project were granted way back in 1992 by the Urban and Housing development department and was to be got renewed in 1994 and accordingly license which is the essence for granting extension under Section 6 of the Act is not valid as on date has expired and the same has not been renewed. Also, the office needs to confirm whether the condition imposed at the time of issuing registration letter with regard to providing of latest title search report from an Advocate having experience of 10 years and above have been complied with. The matter is accordingly put up for the perusal of the Secretary and further orders in this regard. \r\n',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:38:22.000','mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:38:22.000'),(2259,150011,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:42:28.000',1608,10725,'','FormE2020RPR1092','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-11-16 11:42:28.277','','2021-11-16 11:42:28.277',0,'','The original validity of registration in this case was 31.03.2020 after giving the benefit of 6 months on account of Covid-19 the validity stood extended upto 30.09.2020 in view of this authority circular dated 18.05.2021. The applicant is in explanatory note has requested that in addition of 6 months already granted because of the Covid-19 further, extension of validity may be granted for one year i.e. upto 30.09.2021. The Executive General - 3 has stated that the quarterly updates for the year 2020 and first two quarters of 2021 and Form-5 for 2019-20 and 2020-21 have been uploaded however the promoter has not uploaded the quarter updated for 2nd, 3rd, 4th quarter of 2019. (This is the period when the web portal was not available for the purpose of uploading the quarterly updates and Form-5) recently in various cases of OMAX Ltd. there was a decision that promoter may be asked to submit the quarterly updates and Form No. 5 in hard copy prior to the period during which the web portal was not available to the promoters for uploading the above said documents. Accordingly, promoter can be asked to submit the hard copies of quarterly updates and Form No.5 relating to the requisite period. In this case the approval for license to develop Colony has been issued by Senior Town cum Competent Authority SAS Nagar Distt. Mohali under the PAPRA Act, 1995 dated 17.05.2006 when the provisions of RERA were not applicable as it had not been in existence at that point of time. The Architect Certificate dated 06.09.2020 in terms of Form-B attached with certificate suggest that Common Area facilities and amenities required in the development of project has been  mostly completed however, some of the work is still pending to be executed and it seems that the promoter are yet to get the completion certificate from the competent authority.  In the light of the facts stated above, the matter is put up for perusal and consideration of the Secretary and further orders in this regard.',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:42:28.000','mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:42:28.000'),(2260,150011,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:45:11.000',1269,10303,'','FormE2021SAS0026','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-11-16 11:45:11.629','','2021-11-16 11:45:11.629',0,'','This case was registered with RERA on 13.11.2017 for residential development of the project and the initial validity of registration was 31.12.2020. In the light of circular issued by this authority on account of Covid-19, the extension in validity further stood extended upto 30.06.2021. The promoter has requested to grant extension upto 30.06.2023 i.e. for 2 years whereas extension under Section 6 can only be granted upto maximum period of one year and therefore is only entitled to get extension under this provision of this Act upto 30.06.2022. As per the Architect Certificate dated 09.08.2021. The internal and external work of the entire project has mostly been completed barring few tasks/activities in respect of the building. Since for the valid license to develop colony is concerned on the date of evaluation of the application of the applicant it is transpired from the document attached with application that Municipal Corporation through the Executive Officer, MC, Zirakpur vide his letter dated 05.11.2015 has only stated that the colony project in terms of the letter dated 09.12.2011 issued by Director Town and Planning Local Govt. have been approved by MC, Zirakpur as colony falls under the Municipal Limits of Kharar. No other documents showing any kind of extension for the development of the project by competent authority has been uploaded. As per the note of EX(Gen-3),  the promoter has uploaded all the quarterly updates and form-5 as applicable till date. \r\nIn the light of the facts as brought above and in terms of the note of  EX(Gen-3), the case is forwarded to Secretary for his perusal, consideration and further orders in this regard.\r\n',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:45:11.000','mngradminrera','2021-11-16 11:45:11.000'),(2261,150010,'amfnarera','2021-11-17 10:58:56.000',1099,10376,'','FormE2021JAL0039','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Application (General and Finance) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-11-17 10:58:56.401','','2021-11-17 10:58:56.401',0,'','Application Evaluated and Checklist Prepared.  ',2,0,'amfnarera','2021-11-17 10:58:56.000','amfnarera','2021-11-17 10:58:56.000'),(2262,150001,'999','2021-11-17 11:31:07.000',1151,10