ated 10.12.2021 and promoter has complied with all the quarterly updates and Form 5 applicable till date, promoter may be granted extension for one year i.e upto 30.06.2022 (including six months extension due to COVID-19) as per request of the promoter uploaded in explanatory note. Submitted for consideration please.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2021-12-13 14:52:19.000','excgen3rera','2021-12-13 14:52:19.000'),(2322,150006,'excgen3rera','2021-12-13 14:57:23.000',1251,10282,'','FormE2021SAS0021','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-12-13 14:57:25.802','','2021-12-13 14:57:25.802',0,'','Please refer to note dated 14.09.2021 of undersigned and note of Manager (Admn) dated 14.09.2021. Further refer the observation of Secretary dated 29.09.2021 vide which promoter was asked to submit a valid document for validity of the construction period of this project. In compliance to this promoter has submitted NOC issued MC Zirakpur whereby it has been stated that the Final Completion Certificate has not yet been issued to this project and if the construction of the project is continued as per the Punjab Model Building bye Laws 2010 then MC shall no objection for the same. The matter was discussed in the meeting and also put up on hard file. As the matter was approved on dated 10.12.2021 and promoter has complied with all the quarterly updates and Form 5 applicable till date, promoter may be granted extension for one year i.e upto 30.06.2022 (including six months extension due to COVID-19) as per request of the promoter uploaded in explanatory note. Submitted for consideration please.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2021-12-13 14:57:23.000','excgen3rera','2021-12-13 14:57:23.000'),(2323,150011,'mngradminrera','2021-12-13 18:26:12.000',1251,10282,'','FormE2021SAS0021','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-12-13 18:26:15.489','','2021-12-13 18:26:15.