ed 30.11.2018,  vide this office memo no. 8060 dated 01.11.2021, promoter was asked to apply for online extension under section 6 of the Act for one year, thereafter under section 8 of the Act offline, as per this Authority circular dated 18.05.2021.  Submitted for consideration/approval please.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2021-12-17 11:09:54.000','excgen3rera','2021-12-17 11:09:54.000'),(2342,150020,'systemanalyst','2021-12-17 11:14:38.000',1251,10282,'','FormE2021SAS0021','','','Authority Desk','Extension of Registration allocate to approved application','e583ee7f-aaa3-49bd-afc8-79c877afe591','','2021-12-17 11:14:39.752','','2021-12-17 11:14:39.752',0,'','Extension issued under section 6 and moved to public view.',2,0,'systemanalyst','2021-12-17 11:14:38.000','systemanalyst','2021-12-17 11:14:38.000'),(2343,150020,'systemanalyst','2021-12-17 11:18:32.000',1246,10277,'','FormE2021SAS0020','','','Authority Desk','Extension of Registration allocate to approved application','e583ee7f-aaa3-49bd-afc8-79c877afe591','','2021-12-17 11:18:34.284','','2021-12-17 11:18:34.284',0,'','Extension issued and moved to public view.',2,0,'systemanalyst','2021-12-17 11:18:32.000','systemanalyst','2021-12-17 11:18:32.000'),(2344,150014,'excgen3rera','2021-12-20 11:34:29.000',1721,10856,'','FormE2021SAS0047','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-12-20 11:34:32.262','','2021-12-20 11:34:32.262',0,'','Application checklist prepared. Observations filled in the checklist.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2021-12-20 11:34:29.000','excgen3rera','2021-12-20 11:34:29.000'),(2345,150010,'amfnarera','2021-12-20 12:01:29.000',1721,10856,'','FormE2021SAS0047','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Application (General and Finance) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-12-20 12:01:32.279','','2021-12-20 12:01:32.279',0,'','Application Evaluated and Checklist Prepared.  ',2,0,'amfna