nsion in the validity may be granted for one year i.e. upto 30.09.2022. The LDC is valid upto 01.11.2023. The applicant has also uploaded all the quarterly updates and Form 5 applicable till date as per the note of EG(P) . The matter is accordingly submitted for consideration/approval please.',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-12-20 12:48:22.000','mngradminrera','2021-12-20 12:48:22.000'),(2350,150011,'mngradminrera','2021-12-20 12:58:41.000',1987,11160,'','FormE2021SAS0037','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2021-12-20 12:58:44.262','','2021-12-20 12:58:44.262',0,'','The original validity of the project is 31.12.2021. As per the note EG(P) the project of the promoter does not fall under Circular dated 28.10.2020, in which six months extension is granted due to COVID-19. It is pertinent to mention here that the revised registration letter was issued to promoter on 19.07.2021 in supersession of earlier registration letter with new RERA registration Number PBRERA-SAS80-PM0162 (As nature of project was changed from commercial to mixed). Further as per AM (F&A) note dated 18.10.2021 promoter has uploaded all the quarterly updates applicable till date. Promoter has also uploaded FORM 5 for FY 2020-21. The implementation period of the project is valid upto 31.12.2022. As per explanatory note promoter may be granted extension in validity of registration for one year upto 31.12.2022. submitted for consideration/approvals pls.',2,0,'mngradminrera','2021-12-20 12:58:41.000','mngradminrera','2021-12-20 12:58:41.000'),(2351,150006,'excgen3rera','2021-12-21 12:45:46.000',1355,10419,'','FormE2019SAS1016','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2021-12-21 12:45:46.981','','2021-12-21 12:45:46.981',0,'','Resubmitted application evaluated. observations filled in the checklist.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2021-12-21 12:45:46.000','excgen3rera','2021-12-21 