er the comments of evaluation team the promoter has requested extension for one year up to 30.06.2023. The evaluation team has recommended extension up to 16.10.2022. The explanatory note is uploaded by the Sh. Ravinder Kumar Goel Resolution Professional under CIRP as per the stated NCLT order. However the other papers are the copies and the EG(P) has stated that the hard copies of other papers are attested by one Sh. Jasmeet Singh (Probably), however as per the online available registration performa the Authorized signatory is Sh. S.K. Baagolia. Submitted for further necessary action/orders pls.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-09-27 16:42:48.000','mngrprojects.rera','2022-09-27 16:42:48.000'),(3227,150011,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-09-27 16:48:55.000',1454,10557,'','FormE2022SAS0048','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-09-27 16:48:53.842','','2022-09-27 16:48:53.842',0,'','In continuation of last comment, it is pertinent to mention here that now as per the copies of the papers available with EG(P) the Architect is now Sh. Rajinder Saini and Associates which is under process for being dealt by the concerned.',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-09-27 16:48:55.000','mngrprojects.rera','2022-09-27 16:48:55.000'),(3228,150017,'secyrera','2022-09-28 09:53:11.000',1454,10557,'','FormE2022SAS0048','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-09-28 09:53:10.201','','2022-09-28 09:53:10.201',0,'','Extension approved as proposed upto 16.10.2022.',2,0,'secyrera','2022-09-28 09:53:11.000','secyrera','2022-09-28 09:53:11.000'),(3229,150017,'secyrera','2022-09-28 10:10:37.000',1099,10512,'','FormE2022JAL0034','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-09-28 10:10:36.842','','2022-09-28 10:10:36.842',0,'','I have 