timated telephonically to submit the same in the proper format.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2022-11-02 09:39:52.000','excgen3rera','2022-11-02 09:39:52.000'),(3344,150011,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-11-02 10:33:11.000',2143,11308,'','FormE2022SAS0023','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-11-02 10:33:09.922','','2022-11-02 10:33:09.922',0,'','The project is a regularized colony and the as per report of EG(P) the original validity of the registration, in this case, was up to 31.03.2022. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested extension in the validity may be granted for one year i.e. up to 30.03.2023. The indemnity bond submitted was not in proper format and the branch had informed the representative of the promoter to submit in required format which he has promised to submit shortly. in the mean time the matter may be examined for consideration/approval of extension please.',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-11-02 10:33:11.000','mngrprojects.rera','2022-11-02 10:33:11.000'),(3345,150011,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-11-02 10:41:14.000',1539,10650,'','FormE2022SAS0049','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-11-02 10:41:13.140','','2022-11-02 10:41:13.140',0,'','As per the report of EG(P) the registration of this project was granted on basis of technical approval issued by the MC Kharar and the original validity of the registration, in this case, was 19.10.2021. After giving the benefit of six months on account of Covid-19 the validity stood extended up to 19.04.2022. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested that in addition to 6 months already granted. The EG(P) has recommended further extension in the validity may be granted for one year i.e. up to 19.04.2023 and further promoter has submitted the indemnity bond regarding GST for this project in hard copy. Accordingly, the matter is subm