romoter of the project the validity is upto 29.01.2024. Forwarded for consideration/approval please.',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 11:05:23.000','mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 11:05:23.000'),(3532,150011,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 12:01:51.000',1347,10459,'','FormE2022PTL0064','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-12-20 12:01:50.211','','2022-12-20 12:01:50.211',0,'','As per the report of the branch the original validity of registration of the project was up to 31.03.2022, which was further extended for six months up to 30.09.2022 on account of the Covid-19 Pandemic and vide explanatory note promoter has requested an extension up to 31.12.2023. But as per section 6 of the Act, only one-year extension is allowed which comes out to be up to 30.09.2023. As per the copy of the supplementary agreement produced by the produced by the branch in hard file the validity of the said agreement is for 20 years from the date of execution 06.11.2018. Accordingly, the matter is forwarded for consideration please.',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 12:01:51.000','mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 12:01:51.000'),(3533,150011,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 14:27:12.000',1357,10503,'','FormE2022LDH0074','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2022-12-20 14:27:10.771','','2022-12-20 14:27:10.771',0,'','Please refer to the report of the branch regarding Occupation Certificate which is proposed to be considered as Completion Certificate. Forwarded for consideration of extension please.',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 14:27:12.000','mngrprojects.rera','2022-12-20 14:27:12.000'),(3534,150010,'amfnarera','2022-12-20 15:44:26.000',1203,10246,'','FormE2022SAS0084','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Application (General and Finance) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2022