 Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-01-12 13:14:24.345','','2023-01-12 13:14:24.345',0,'','The original validity of registration in this case was 31.12.2021. After giving the benefit of six months on account of Covid-19 the validity stood extended upto 30.06.2022. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested that in addition to 6 months already granted, further extension in the validity may be granted upto 31.12.2023. But as per section 6 of the Act, only one year extension is allowed which comes out to be up 30.06.2023. It is pertinent to mention here that the project is a mega project and promoter has submitted copy of the Agreement dated 11.10.2002 between the Govt. of Punjab and M/s Sukham Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd along with the copy of a letter dated 27.12.2017, vide which the competent Authority has extended the implementation period of this mega project up to 27.03.2022. As per clause 4 of the said letter, it is stated that the promoter shall be liable to pay EDC, License fee etc. within the 4 months from the date of release of the Revised Layout Plan, and zoning plan of 143.254 acres. Further the promoter has also submitted a copy of the Govt. Notification dated 30.01.2020 and 09.03.2020, regarding extension in validity of licenses projects and mega projects upto 31.12.2022. As the implementation period of this project is valid upto 31.12.2022 according to the Govt. notification, therefore the matter is submitted for consideration/approval of extension upto 31.12.2022.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2023-01-12 13:14:24.000','excgen3rera','2023-01-12 13:14:24.000'),(3613,150006,'excgen3rera','2023-01-12 16:35:07.000',1105,10188,'','FormE2022LDH0040','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-01-12 16:35:07.800','','2023-01-12 16:35:07.800',0,'','Resubmitted application evaluated. Observations as per the checklist.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2023-01-12 16:35:07