osited by him for renewal of licence. All other requirements for grant of extension u/s 6 have been met by the promoter. Extension u/s 6 may be considered',2,0,'ManagerIT.rera','2023-02-10 09:45:42.000','ManagerIT.rera','2023-02-10 09:45:42.000'),(3751,150010,'amfnarera','2023-02-10 11:31:27.000',2030,11198,'','FormE2023SAS0013','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Application (General and Finance) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-02-10 11:31:27.366','','2023-02-10 11:31:27.366',0,'','Application Evaluated and Checklist Prepared. ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-02-10 11:31:27.000','amfnarera','2023-02-10 11:31:27.000'),(3752,150006,'excgen3rera','2023-02-10 11:32:34.000',1057,10096,'','FormE2022LDH0077','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-02-10 11:32:34.855','','2023-02-10 11:32:34.855',0,'','The original validity of the registration, in this case, was 30.04.2022. After giving the benefit of six months on account of Covid-19 the validity stood extended up to 30.10.2022. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested that in addition to 6 months already granted, further extension in the validity may be granted up to 31.10.2023. The promoter has submitted a letter dated 27.01.2023 issued by the Competent Authority vide which the implementation/completion period of the mega project is extended up to 31.12.2023. The matter is accordingly submitted for consideration/approval of extension in the registration period up to 31.10.2023, under section 6 of the Act.',2,0,'excgen3rera','2023-02-10 11:32:34.000','excgen3rera','2023-02-10 11:32:34.000'),(3753,150006,'excgen3rera','2023-02-10 11:36:25.000',1057,10097,'','FormE2022LDH0078','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-02-10 11:36:25.725','','2023-02-10 11:36:25.725',0,'','The original validity of the registration, in this case, was 30.04.2022. After giv