istration in this case was upto 20.03.2023 and the promoter has  provided the renewed copy of the License to Develop colony which is valid up to 19.03.2025 and issued in favor of Indian Cooperative House Building Society Ltd. who is the promoter of the main project Suntec City. The promoter has requested for extension in registration period for one year i.e. upto 20.03.2024. While seeing the layout plan it has come to notice that the Khasra Numbers mentioned in the Architect Report and layout plan are not matching i.e Khasra no. 26//20/3 is missing in the Layout plan, which is for your consideration please. The matter regarding extension is accordingly submitted for the consideration/further orders please.',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2023-05-25 14:47:53.000','mngrprojects.rera','2023-05-25 14:47:53.000'),(4029,150011,'mngrprojects.rera','2023-05-25 15:02:24.000',1876,11045,'','FormE2023LDH0022','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-05-25 15:02:25.500','','2023-05-25 15:02:25.500',0,'','May please see the comments of the evaluation team according to which  the original validity of this project Park Lane is 31.07.2020 which was further extended automatically for six months in view of COVID-19 situation i.e. up to 31.01.2021. The promoter has uploaded / submitted the copy of order dated 17.08.2016 vide which the said colony Park Lane has been regularized by the Competent Authority i.e. Municipal Corporation, Ludhiana. The promoter has requested for further extension under Section 6 for a period of one year which works out to 31.01.2022. Accordingly , as per discussion  the case for extension under Section 6  is  submitted for consideration  please. ',2,0,'mngrprojects.rera','2023-05-25 15:02:24.000','mngrprojects.rera','2023-05-25 15:02:24.000'),(4030,150026,'mngrprojects.rera','2023-05-25 15:08:37.000',2110,11272,'','FormE2023SAS0018','','','Authority Desk','Application Return Back 