ct i.e. Phase-II namely Leela Orchid Green Phase-II in RERA, which is pending for registration.  After verifying the application form applied online for Phase-II project, it has transpired that the promoter has applied for development of Phase-II project for an area measuring 1.88 acres, which means that the promoter totally applied for 4 acres of the land with this Authority out of the 5 acres land till date (2.12 acres i.e. registered earlier and 1.88 acres i.e. applied for). However, the promoter is silent on the balance 1 acres land.  Accordingly, the request of the promoter for extension under Section 6 i.e. upto 14.05.2024 is submitted for consideration and further directions please. ',2,0,'excgen5','2023-06-22 16:49:47.000','excgen5','2023-06-22 16:49:47.000'),(4084,150014,'excgen5','2023-06-23 11:18:24.000',1542,10651,'','FormE2023SAS0020','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-06-23 11:18:26.811','','2023-06-23 11:18:26.811',0,'','Checklist Prepared.',2,0,'excgen5','2023-06-23 11:18:24.000','excgen5','2023-06-23 11:18:24.000'),(4085,150010,'amfnarera','2023-06-23 11:43:07.000',1542,10651,'','FormE2023SAS0020','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Application (General and Finance) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-06-23 11:43:09.045','','2023-06-23 11:43:09.045',0,'','Application Evaluated and Checklist Prepared. ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-06-23 11:43:07.000','amfnarera','2023-06-23 11:43:07.000'),(4086,150001,'999','2023-06-23 11:57:12.000',1510,10617,'999','FormE2023SAS0056','Form-E Submitted (New Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Submitted','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2023-06-23 11:57:12.000','999','2023-06-23 11:57:12.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Submitted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-06-23 11:57:12.000','sysadmin','2023-06-23 11:57:12.000'),(4087,150