itted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-02 12:27:44.000','sysadmin','2023-12-02 12:27:44.000'),(4624,150004,'999','2023-12-04 10:49:58.000',1094,10461,'999','FormE2023SAS0081','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-04 10:49:58.000','999','2023-12-04 10:49:58.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-04 10:49:58.000','sysadmin','2023-12-04 10:49:58.000'),(4625,150011,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 11:57:39.000',1476,10574,'','FormE2023LDH0109','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-04 11:57:43.415','','2023-12-04 11:57:43.415',0,'','It is informed that the project was registered in RERA, vide letter no. 808 dated 25.09.2017 issuing Registration No. PBRERA-LDH42-PR0116.  The Promoter had not entered the valid date for completion in Form B and the validity of the RERA registration is also not mentioned in the above said Registration Letter.  Further, the Promoter has mentioned the reason for seeking extension as Covid-19, in this regard, the kind attention is drawn the explanation given in Section-6, wherein, it is mentioned that for the purpose of this section, the expression force majeure shall mean a case of war, flood, drought, fire, cyclone, earthquake or any other calamity caused by nature affecting the regular development of the real estate project. Furthermore, the Promoter has also attached the copy of Form 1 - Architects Certificate (along with Table A and Table B), RERA Registration Certificate, Valid License to develop colony project, State of development work and reason for not completing (explanatory note), Proforma for Undertaking-cum-Indemnity Bond.  However, the uploaded Layout Plan is only Technically Approved, therefore, we may ask for the Sanctioned copy of Layout Plan.\r\n		It is also apprised that the copy of CLU dated 13.07.2017 and License dated 14.11.2017 under PAPRA (area 16.0556 Acres) are uploaded, however, the Promoter has now provided the hard copy of the extension of the License vide PUC, which is issued on 20.11.2023 and is valid till 13.11.2024.  Further, in compliance of the conditions of License, the Promoter has submitted (in hard copy) or uploaded the PSPCL NOC dated 13.12.2022, Forest NOC dated 25.01.2018 and PPCB NOC dated 05.09.2017, however, the PWD NOC dated 03.10.2017 is in favor of Mangla Enclave and not addressed to Mangla                 Enclave II, needs clarification from the Promoter.  If approved, we may ask for the copy of Sanctioned Zoning Plan and Drainage NOC, in compliance of condition No. 14 and 21 respectively.  \r\n		Submitted Please. 	\r\n	\r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 11:57:39.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 11:57:39.000'),(4626,150007,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 11:59:10.000',1703,10887,'','FormE2023SAS0104','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-04 11:59:13.931','','2023-12-04 11:59:13.931',0,'','Please attend to the observations of the Evaluation Team raised in the checklist, so as to enable this office to proceed further in the matter.',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 11:59:10.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 11:59:10.000'),(4628,150006,'amfnarera','2023-12-04 12:00:11.000',1342,10646,'','FormE2023SAS0108','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-12-04 12:00:15.071','','2023-12-04 12:00:15.071',0,'','Observations as per Checklist. ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-12-04 12:00:11.000','amfnarera','2023-12-04 12:00:11.000'),(4629,150007,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-04 12:01:30.000',1637,10777,'','FormE2023SAS0103','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)'