plete the project development works in this given time, the same may be seen w.r.t the provisions of the Section-6. \r\nFurther, it is also apprised that vide this office comments dated 31.08.2023, the Promoter was asked to submit some NOCs, out of which he has submitted NOC of Fire, Height, PPCB and EC.  It is also pertinent to mention here that the PPCB NOC has expired on 10.10.2023 but at the same time the NOC was valid at the time of submission of application. Furthermore, in compliance of the orders dated 10.10.2023 of your good-self on this portal, the Secretary, RERA has issued a letter No. 16096 dated 17.11.2023 to the Chief Administrator, GMADA in order to seek the clarification regarding the validity period of the said project w.r.t the Allotment Letter, the reply of which has not yet been received. However, the Promoter has submitted the Affidavit in hard form stating that allotment of project site, bank loan and completion of project. Now, they have submitted the same stating that the project has been completed and they are going to apply for OC to GMADA.  \r\n	Accordingly, the matter is submitted for the consideration of approval or further orders please. \r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-07 16:40:13.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-07 16:40:13.000'),(4689,150006,'amfnarera','2023-12-07 16:44:35.000',1335,10383,'','FormE2023SAS0116','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-12-07 16:44:36.837','','2023-12-07 16:44:36.837',0,'','Observations as per Checklist.  ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-12-07 16:44:35.000','amfnarera','2023-12-07 16:44:35.000'),(4690,150006,'amfnarera','2023-12-07 16:47:43.000',1223,10252,'','FormE2023BTI0122','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-12-07 16:47:44.821','','2023-12-07 16:47:44.821',0,'','Observations as per Checklist. ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-12-07 16:47:43.000','amfnarera','2023-12-07 16:47:43.000'),(