,'Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-12-08 09:27:01.775','','2023-12-08 09:27:01.775',0,'','Observations as per Checklist.  ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-12-08 09:26:59.000','amfnarera','2023-12-08 09:26:59.000'),(4697,150014,'os.projects1','2023-12-08 09:46:27.000',1058,10043,'','FormE2023SAS0125','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-12-08 09:46:29.790','','2023-12-08 09:46:29.790',0,'','Project Land Details (Form-E) related evaluation and observations prepared and filled in checklist as per Standard Checklist.',2,0,'os.projects1','2023-12-08 09:46:27.000','os.projects1','2023-12-08 09:46:27.000'),(4698,150006,'amfnarera','2023-12-08 09:52:43.000',1058,10043,'','FormE2023SAS0125','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2023-12-08 09:52:44.978','','2023-12-08 09:52:44.978',0,'','Observations as per Checklist.  ',2,0,'amfnarera','2023-12-08 09:52:43.000','amfnarera','2023-12-08 09:52:43.000'),(4699,150011,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 10:52:18.000',1797,10976,'','FormE2023SAS0035','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 10:52:20.009','','2023-12-08 10:52:20.009',0,'','The case in question pertains to the request of the Promoter Parkwood Promoters for seeking the extension of registration for his project named Metro Town.  Now, vide the application in question the Promoter has stated that due to the following reasons, the project implementation has got delayed due to Delay in getting License renewal, Delay in getting NOCs and other permissions for the project, Non availability of finance from bank or financial institutions, One or some of the partners not able to provide the capital for the project, Low customer collection due to poor market demand, Change in partnership arrangements, Completion applied for may take another 6 months or 1 year or 2 years to get the Completion Certificate, Shortage of material and labour and Project revision or amendment or modification. Accordingly, he has requested for seeking extension of registration further for 1 year i.e. is up to 30.06.2023. However, the above quoted reasons may be seen w.r.t the provisions of the Section-6. \r\nThe Promoter has uploaded Approved Layout Plan (the document uploaded is the same document as submitted during the time of registration), Explanatory note, Regularization Certificate dated 04.09.2017, Registration Certificate as granted by this Authority dated 20.02.2018, Architect Certificate indicating the details of land along with the scope of work completed Development Works dated 29.04.2023 and Indemnity Bond dated 03.04.2023. Further, vide letter dated 04.09.2017 of the Competent Authority, the Regularization Certificate was issued for 6.30 Acre.  The promoter has provided copy of the NOC of PSPCL dated 30.08.2018, which has been expired on 30.08.2020. However, no other NOC or approval of any department has been provided, may be seen. \r\nIn this regard, it is apprised that the Promoter was issued the Registration Letter for the said project vide Memo No. RERA/2018/101 dated 20.02.2018, issuing the RERA Registration No. PBRERA-SAS79-PR0281, which was valid up to 31.12.2021.  However, the Registration was extended for 6 months due to COVID-19, which was valid up to 30.06.2022.	\r\nOn the basis of the above facts, the matter is submitted for the consideration of approval or further orders please. \r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 10:52:18.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 10:52:18.000'),(4700,150011,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 11:50:49.000',1019,10222,'','FormE2023JAL0089','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 11:50:51.165','','2023-12-08 11:50:51.165',0,'','The case in question pertains to the request of the Promoter Triworld Developers for seeking the extension of registration for his project named Royal Residency  stating that because of the delayed project implementation has got delayed due to delay in getting License renewal, delay in getting NOCs and other permissions for the project, non availability of finance from bank or financial institutions, one or some of the partners not able to provide the capital for the project, low customer collection due to poor market demand, change in partnership arrangements, completion applied for may take another 6 months or 1 year or 2 years to get the Completion Certificate, shortage of material and labour and Project revision or amendment or modification. Accordingly, he has requested for seeking extension of registration further for 1 year. However, the above quoted reasons may be seen w.r.t the provisions of the Section-6. \r\nThe Promoter has uploaded Revised Sanctioned Layout Plan, Explanatory note, Architect Certificate indicating the details of land along with the scope of work completed Development Works dated 11.09.2023 and Notarized Indemnity Bond dated 04.09.2023. Further, the promoter has also provided request of renewal of PWD NOC dated 14.09.2022, Sewerage NOC dated 10.01.2018 and NOC of PSPCL dated 12.11.2020, which has been expired on 12.11.2022.  However, in compliance of the cond. No. 8 & 11 respectively, the Zoning Plan and NOCs or Clearances from PPCB, Drainage, Forest, Solid Waste, EC and IAF are not submitted. \r\n In this regard, it is apprised that Certificate of renewal of PAPRA License dated 23.08.2023 is valid up to 05.02.2025. Further, the Promoter was issued the Registration Letter for the said project vide Memo No. RERA/2018/586 dated 18.09.2018, issuing the RERA Registration No. PBRERA-JAL33-PR0388, which was valid up to 05.02.2023 and Revised Registration Certificate granted by this Authority dated 27.09.2019 was also Valid up to 05.02.2023.  However, the Registration was extended for 6 months due to COVID-19, which was valid up to 05.08.2023. Furthermore, if the request of the Promoter is granted, we may grant extension up to 05.08.2024.  \r\nOn the basis of the above facts, the matter is submitted for the consideration of approval or further orders please. \r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 11:50:49.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 11:50:49.000'),(4701,150001,'999','2023-12-08 13:55:09.000',2083,11247,'999','FormE2023SAS0126','Form-E Submitted (New Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Submitted','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-08 13:55:09.000','999','2023-12-08 13:55:09.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Submitted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-08 13:55:09.000','sysadmin','2023-12-08 13:55:09.000'),(4702,150011,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 15:57:08.000',1114,10146,'','FormE2023SAS0093','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 15:57:10.056','','2023-12-08 15:57:10.056',0,'','In this regard, it is apprised that the LDC is dated 30.01.2020, which is valid up to   30.01.2025. Further, the Promoter was issued the Registration Letter for the said project vide Memo No. RERA/2018/622 dated 11.10.2018, issuing the RERA Registration No. PBRERA-SAS79-PR0394, which was valid up to 10.04.2023 and Revised Registration Certificate granted by this Authority dated 08.03.2021, for Residential (Group Housing) for area measuring 12081 Sqm., 3 nos. (Block 1 to 3), 24 nos. 4 BHK and 144 nos. 3 BHK (total 168 nos.) was also valid up to 10.04.2023.  However, the Registration was extended for 6 months due to COVID-19, which was valid up to 10.10.2023. Furthermore, if the request of the Promoter is approved, we may grant extension up to 10.10.2024.  \r\nOn the basis of the above facts, the matter is submitted for the consideration of approval or further orders please. \r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 15:57:08.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 15:57:08.000'),(4703,150011,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 15:58:03.000',1114,10146,'','FormE2023SAS0093','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 15:58:05.259','','2023-12-08 15:58:05.259',0,'','	The case in question pertains to the request of the Promoter GVT INFRA for seeking the extension of registration for his project named Belliston Avenues.  Now, vide the application in question, the Promoter has stated that due to the following reasons, the project implementation because of the delayed project implementation due to delay in getting License renewal, delay in getting NOCs and other permissions for the project, non availability of finance from bank or financial institutions, one or some of the partners not able to provide the capital for the project, low customer collection due to poor market demand, change in partnership arrangements, completion applied for may take another 6 months or 1 year or 2 years to get the Completion Certificate, shortage of material and labour and project revision or amendment or modification. Accordingly, he has requested for seeking extension of registration further for 1 year i.e. is up to 10.10.2024. However, the above quoted reasons may be seen w.r.t the provisions of the Section-6. \r\nThe Promoter has uploaded Approved Layout Plan (the document uploaded is the same document as submitted during the time of registration), Explanatory note, Architect Certificate indicating the details of land along with the scope of work completed Development Works dated 29.08.2018 and Notarized Indemnity Bond dated 29.09.2023. Further, the promoter has also provided PSPCL NOC dated 12.05.2023, Fire NOC dated 23.02.2018, Environment NOC dated 07.09.2018.  However, in compliance of the cond. No. 15, 21 & 30 respectively, the NOCs or Clearances from PPCB, in this regard the Promoter has submitted that the said NOC will be submitted in this office as and when issued by the concerned department. In context with the Drainage NOC, Forest Department NOC and Road Access, the Promoter himself has claimed that these clearances are not applicable in this case, may be seen.  (continued)\r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 15:58:03.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-08 15:58:03.000'),(4704,150017,'member.rera','2023-12-08 16:52:02.000',1114,10146,'','FormE2023SAS0093','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 16:52:04.946','','2023-12-08 16:52:04.946',0,'','The extension is granted under Section 6 up o 10.10.2024 in continuation to the registration granted vide letter no. RERA/2018/622 dated 11.10.2018 which was granted up to 10.04.2023 and further by six months due to COVID-19 extended up to 10.10.2023. The approval for extension to Belliston Avenues under section 6 is granted up to 10.10.2024. The promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities at least one month before 10.10.2024 and complete the project within the extended period. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. ',2,0,'member.rera','2023-12-08 16:52:02.000','member.rera','2023-12-08 16:52:02.000'),(4705,150017,'member.rera','2023-12-08 16:57:15.000',1019,10222,'','FormE2023JAL0089','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 16:57:17.838','','2023-12-08 16:57:17.838',0,'','The extension is granted under Section 6 upto 05.08.2024 in continuation to the registration granted vide letter no. RERA/2018/586 dated 18.09.2018 which was granted up to 05.02.2023 and further by six months due to COVID-19 extended up to 05.08.2023. The approval for extension to Belliston Avenues under section 6 is granted up to 05.08.2024. The promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities at least one month before 05.08.2024 and complete the project within the extended period. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. ',2,0,'member.rera','2023-12-08 16:57:15.000','member.rera','2023-12-08 16:57:15.000'),(4706,150017,'member.rera','2023-12-08 17:16:20.000',1797,10976,'','FormE2023SAS0035','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 17:16:22.103','','2023-12-08 17:16:22.103',0,'','The extension is granted hereby under Section 6 upto 30.06.2023 in continuation to the registration granted vide letter no. RERA/2018/101 dated 20.02.2018 which was granted up to 31.12.2021 and further by six months due to COVID-19 extended up to 30.06.2022. The promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities immediately and complete the project expeditiously. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. The promoter has faulted in not getting the extension before due date of expiry of the registration by this Authority. This extension does not grant immunity from any violation, if committed during the period from 01.07.2022 to 08.12.2023.',2,0,'member.rera','2023-12-08 17:16:20.000','member.rera','2023-12-08 17:16:20.000'),(4707,150026,'member.rera','2023-12-08 17:22:42.000',1476,10574,'','FormE2023LDH0109','','','Authority Desk','Application Return Back to Evaluation Team','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 17:22:44.103','','2023-12-08 17:22:44.103',0,'','Please comment regarding the validity of registration period not mentioned in the Form-B as well as the Registration certificate. Please suggest the period for granting extension with the starting date along with justification for the same.',2,0,'member.rera','2023-12-08 17:22:42.000','member.rera','2023-12-08 17:22:42.000'),(4708,150017,'member.rera','2023-12-08 18:06:08.000',1833,11024,'','FormE2023SAS0072','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 18:06:10.134','','2023-12-08 18:06:10.134',0,'','\r\nThe registration for project Central Street being developed by Alaknanda Enterprises Private Limited was granted vide letter no. RERA/2019/655-656 dated 16.12.2019 which was granted up to 31.01.2023 and further by six months due to COVID-19 extended up to 31.07.2023. GMADA, the Competent Authority did not mention any time limit for the construction period in condition no. 4(III) of the Allotment letter vide Memo no. EO/2019/26098 dated 02.05.2019. In this respect a clarification was sought from GMADA vide this office letter dated Memo no. RERA/SECY/EG(NG)/2023/16096 dated 17.11.2023 but no reply has been received. The promoter has filed an affidavit stating that the project has been completed and it is going to apply for seeking Occupation Certificate from GMADA shortly. The said request has been considered and the application for extension was processed. Accordingly, the extension is granted hereby under Section 6 of Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 up to 31.07.2024.\r\nThe promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities at least one month before 31.07.2024 and complete the project within the extended period. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. The promoter has faulted in not getting the extension before due date of expiry of the registration period granted by this Authority. This extension under section 6 of RERD Act, 2016 does not grant immunity from any violation, if committed during the period from 01.08.2023 to 08.12.2023.\r\n',2,0,'member.rera','2023-12-08 18:06:08.000','member.rera','2023-12-08 18:06:08.000'),(4709,150026,'member.rera','2023-12-08 18:08:31.000',1557,10793,'','FormE2022SAS0101','','','Authority Desk','Application Return Back to Evaluation Team','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-08 18:08:33.149','','2023-12-08 18:08:33.149',0,'','Please check validity of the Building Permit issue and license validity as discussed',2,0,'member.rera','2023-12-08 18:08:31.000','member.rera','2023-12-08 18:08:31.000'),(4710,150007,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-11 09:47:28.000',1058,10043,'','FormE2023SAS0125','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-11 09:47:32.226','','2023-12-11 09:47:32.226',0,'','Please attend to the observations of the Evaluation Team raised in the checklist, so as to enable this office to proceed further in the matter.',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-11 09:47:28.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-11 09:47:28.000'),(4711,150007,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-11 09:48:00.000',1072,10109,'','FormE2023SAS0058','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-11 09:48:04.804','','2023-12-11 09:48:04.804',0,'','Please attend to the observations of the Evaluation Team raised in the checklist, so 