roject named Beverly Golf Avenue Phase-2 stating that the Covid-19 pandemics second wave struck the nation with devastating economic impact.  There was an acute shortage of labour force in the construction industry with sky rocketing costs of building material and rising fuel prices.  All of this impacted the real estate sector to a major extent.  For nearly over a year the situation of availability of material and labour was directly hampered leading to loss of time and financial losses to the industry.  Besides this seeking statutory approvals from various Govt. bodies have been a challenge which also contributed to the delays. However, the above quoted reasons may be seen w.r.t the provisions of the Section-6. \r\nThe Promoter has uploaded Sanctioned Layout Plan, Explanatory note, Architect Certificate indicating the details of land along with the scope of work completed Development Works dated 16.10.2023 and Notarized Indemnity Bond dated 16.10.2023. The letter of allotment granted by the competent authority which is GMADA was given on 20.10.2015. Further, the promoter has also provided Fire Safety Certificate dated 27.06.2023, NOC for Construction of Building dated 05.11.2021 (which is valid for 5 years), Environment Clearance was granted on 21.03.2016 subsequently, amendment of EC was granted on 15.07.2022 and further, clarification regarding EC was given on 03.10.2023 stating the validity is up to 20.03.2026, PPCB NOC dated 18.05.2023 valid up to 31.03.2024, PSPCL NOC dated 21.01.2022 (the validity of NOC is 5 years). However, the letter of allotment specifically states to obtain a NOC from Airport Authority of India which we have not taken during the time of registration. Therefore, it is proposed to get a NOC for Airport Authority to grant extension.  (in continuation..)\r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-26 10:30:05.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-26 10:30:05.000'),(4791,150011,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-26 10:30:18.000',1342,10646,'','FormE2023SAS0108','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2023-12-26 10:30:18.586','','2023-12-26 10:30:18.602',0,'',' In this regard, the Promoter was issued the Registration Letter for the said project vide Memo No. RERA.2019.216 dated 23.04.2019, issuing the RERA Registration No. PBRERA-JAL33-PR0451, which was valid up to 31.07.2023 and Revised Registration Certificate was granted by this Authority vide Memo No. RERA.2021.93 dated 16.02.2021.  However, the Registration was extended for 6 months due to COVID-19, which was valid up to 31.01.2024. Furthermore, if the request of the Promoter is granted, we may grant extension up to 30.01.2025.  \r\nOn the basis of the above facts, the matter is submitted for the consideration for approval and further orders please. \r\n',2,0,'ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-26 10:30:18.000','ManagerTP.rera','2023-12-26 10:30:18.000'),(4792,150004,'999','2023-12-26 14:47:19.000',1703,10887,'999','FormE2023SAS0104','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-26 14:47:19.000','999','2023-12-26 14:47:19.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-26 14:47:19.000','sysadmin','2023-12-26 14:47:19.000'),(4793,150001,'999','2023-12-27 13:04:34.000',1648,10788,'999','FormE2023SAS0134','Form-E Submitted (New Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Submitted','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2023-12-27 13:04:34.000','999','2023-12-27 13:04:34.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Submitted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2023-12-27 13:04:34.000','sysadmin','2023-12-27 13:04:34.000'),(4794,150014,'os.projects1','2023-12-27 13:05:05.000',1320,10609,'','FormE2023SAS0132','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a