a','2024-01-01 10:00:03.000','ManagerTP.rera','2024-01-01 10:00:03.000'),(4837,150006,'os.projects1','2024-01-01 10:36:00.000',1703,10887,'','FormE2023SAS0104','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-01-01 10:36:04.877','','2024-01-01 10:36:04.877',0,'','Observations as per checklist.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-01-01 10:36:00.000','os.projects1','2024-01-01 10:36:00.000'),(4838,150006,'os.projects1','2024-01-01 12:42:44.000',1775,10922,'','FormE2023SAS0062','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-01-01 12:42:48.877','','2024-01-01 12:42:48.877',0,'','The original validity of the registration of this project was up to 31.03.2022. Further, the extension for six months i.e. up to 30.09.2022 was also granted due to the COVID-19, as per Circular dated 28.10.2020. The promoter had submitted Provisional Regularization certificate for Un-authorized colony dated 20.02.2019. They have also submitted Final Regularization certificate vide Letter no. DDLG-2020/77 dated 01.07.2020 granted by Local Government, Patiala. Further, they have also submitted the Completion Certificate granted by the Office of ADC (UD) of SAS Nagar dated 28.07.2023. The promoter is requesting for grant of extension till 30.09.2023 to cover the period upto grant of CC. Accordingly, the case is submitted for consideration /approval of extension U/s 6 for one year i.e. up to 30.09.2023.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-01-01 12:42:44.000','os.projects1','2024-01-01 12:42:44.000'),(4839,150004,'999','2024-01-01 13:54:21.000',1843,10997,'999','FormE2022JAL0088','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-01 13:54:21.000','999','2024-01-01 13:54:21.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-01-01 13:54:21.000','sysadmin','2024-01-01 13:54:21.000'),(4840,150004,'999','2024-01-01 13:58:25.000',1843,10998,'999','FormE2022JAL0090','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-01 13:58:25.000','999','2024-01-01 13:58:25.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-01-01 13:58:25.000','sysadmin','2024-01-01 13:58:25.000'),(4841,150017,'member.rera','2024-01-01 17:01:10.000',1557,10793,'','FormE2022SAS0101','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-01-01 17:01:14.846','','2024-01-01 17:01:14.846',0,'','Sh. Ashutosh Verma, Sh. Namit Takkar and Sh. Amit Mittal attended and submitted that project is complete and has applied for completion certificate. All the NOCs have been obtained. All units except 2 have been sold. The common areas have been handed over to the RWA. The MC, Zirakpur is insisting for valid RERA Registration before issuing the completion certificate.\r\nThe extension is granted hereby under Section 6 upto 30.06.2024 in continuation to the registration granted vide letter no. RERA/2017/1258 dated 02.11.2017 which was granted up to 31.12.2022 and further by six months due to COVID-19 extended up to 30.06.2023. The promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities immediately and complete the project expeditiously. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension does not grant immunity from any violation, if committed during the period from 01.07.2023 to 31.12.2023. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension will not entitle the promoter to extend the date of possession as per Clause 7.1 of the Agreement for Sale and u/s 18 of the Act. \r\n',2,0,'member.rera','2024-01-01 17:01:10.000','member.rera','2024-01-01 17:01:10.000'),(4842,150004,'999','2024-01-02 11:08:44.000',1637,10777,'999','FormE2023SAS0103','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-02 11:08:44.000','999','2024-01-02 11:08:44.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-01-02 11:08:44.000','sysadmin','2024-01-02 11:08:44.000'),(4843,150007,'member.rera','2024-01-02 13:06:08.000',1006,11269,'','FormE2023SAS0124','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-01-02 13:06:08.221','','2024-01-02 13:06:08.221',0,'','The promoter has submitted the agreement between Government and JLPL. He may be asked to submit the Extension in implementation period in Mega Project granted by the Government in which the time limit is extended at least up to the date of the extension required under section 6 of the Act. Returned back to promoter for compliance.',2,0,'member.rera','2024-01-02 13:06:08.000','member.rera','2024-01-02 13:06:08.000'),(4844,150004,'999','2024-01-03 08:54:08.000',1516,10634,'999','FormE2020SAS1112','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-01-03 08:54:08.000','999','2024-01-03 08:54:08.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sys