list.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-02-05 14:44:07.000','os.projects1','2024-02-05 14:44:07.000'),(5008,150017,'member.rera','2024-02-05 15:43:52.000',1518,10627,'','FormE2022SAS0021','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-05 15:43:56.780','','2024-02-05 15:43:56.780',0,'','The extension is granted hereby under section 6 up to 30.06.2023 in continuation to the registration granted vide letter no. RERA/2018/122 dated 26.02.2018 which was granted up to 30.12.2021 and further by six months due to COVID-19 extended up to 30.06.2022. The approved Building Permit issued by MC, Derabassi on 12.05.2023 is valid for a period of three years (valid upto 11.05.2026).The promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities immediately and complete the project expeditiously. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension does not grant immunity from any violation of Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016 if committed during the period of lapse of validity of registration granted by Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab.  The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension will not entitle the promoter to extend the date of possession under Clause 7.1 of the Agreement for Sale and u/s 18 of the RERD Act, 2016.',2,0,'member.rera','2024-02-05 15:43:52.000','member.rera','2024-02-05 15:43:52.000'),(5009,150017,'member.rera','2024-02-05 17:16:57.000',1476,10574,'','FormE2023LDH0109','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-05 17:17:01.671','','2024-02-05 17:17:01.671',0,'','The extension is granted hereby under section 6 up to 24.03.2024. The promoter did not mention completion date in Form B submitted at the time of registration and it was registered offline. The RERA registration was granted vide letter no. RERA/2017/808 dated 25.09.2017. The promoter has provided with a renewed and extended license in hard copy vide PUC 8214 dated 30.11.2023 valid up to 13.11.2024. In the facts and circumstances, it is presumed that the completion date for the project will be taken as five years from the validity of registration granted under RERA. Therefore, the registration for RERA in the peculiar facts and circumstances is presumed to have been given upto 25.09.2022 in this case and extended further by six months due to COVID 19 and it could be presumed to have been extended up to 24.03.2023. Now the application for extension has been filed u/s 6 under which extension can be granted for 1 year from the date of registration validity under RERA or till the date of validity of License to Develop Colony whichever is earlier. Since the LDC is valid upto 13.11.2024 therefore the extension has been considered u/s 6 upto 24.03.2024 one year from the date of expiry of registration granted by RERA. The promoter is directed to obtain all the valid NOCs from the respective Competent Authorities immediately and complete the project expeditiously. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension does not grant immunity from any violation of Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016 if committed during the period of lapse of validity of registration granted by Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab.  The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension will not entitle the promoter to extend the date of possession under Clause 7.1 of the Agreement for Sale u/s 18 of the RERD Act, 2016.',2,0,'member.rera','2024-02-05 17:16:57.000','member.rera','2024-02-05 17:16:57.000'),(5010,150004,'999','2024-02-06 10:50:12.000',1214,10239,'999','FormE2022SAS0085','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-06 10:50:12.000','999','2024-02-06 10:50:12.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-06 10:50:12.000','sysadmin','2024-02-06 10:50:12.000'),(5011,150004,'999','2024-02-06 15:45:51.000',1597,10714,'999','FormE2023SAS0051','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-06 15:45:51.000','999','2024-02-06 15:45:51.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-06 15:45:51.000','sysadmin','2024-02-06 15:45:51.000'),(5012,150004,'999','2024-02-07 10:29:33.000',1542,10651,'999','FormE2023SAS0020','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-02-07 10:29:33.000','999','2024-02-07 10:29:33.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-02-07 10:29:33.000','sysadmin','2024-02-07 10:29:33.000'),(5013,150006,'os.projects1','2024-02-07 12:10: