-02-20 17:08:40.568',0,'','The extension is granted hereby under section 6 up to 30.06.2024 in continuation to the registration granted vide Letter No. RERA/2021/113-114 dated 03.03.2021 which was granted up to 31.12.2023. The promoter has uploaded the building permit vide Memo no. 51897 dated 18.12.2020 granted by GMADA vide which the project was registered. The permit does not state a validity period of the document. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension does not grant immunity from any violation of Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016 if committed during the period of lapse of validity of registration granted by Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension will not entitle the promoter to extend the date of possession under Clause 7.1 of the Agreement for Sale and u/s 18 of the RERD Act, 2016.',2,0,'member.rera','2024-02-20 17:08:40.000','member.rera','2024-02-20 17:08:40.000'),(5104,150017,'member.rera','2024-02-20 17:17:51.000',1329,10373,'','FormE2023BNL0084','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-02-20 17:17:51.537','','2024-02-20 17:17:51.537',0,'','The extension is granted hereby under section 6 up to 14.12.2023 in continuation to the registration granted vide Letter No. RERA/2019/375 dated 15.07.2019 which was granted up to 31.12.2022.  Further, the extension for six months i.e. up to 30.06.2023 was also granted due to the COVID-19, as per Circular dated 28.10.2020. The promoter had uploaded LDC from the date of 26.07.2006 to 26.07.2009. The promoter has uploaded a letter from Patiala Urban Planning And Development Authority Patiala vide Memo No. PDA/Admin-S-2/PTA/2021//2254 dated 10.03.2021 in which the certificate of renewal of license is provided. The renewal is extended from 01.01.2021 to 31.12.2021. The promoter has uploaded the completion certificate vide Memo no. 36256 dated 14.12.2023. To cover the gap period of validity of registration and the date of submission of Completion certificate the extension may be granted for 6 months. During the time from 01.01.2022 to 14.12.2023 the license is deemed to be approved by the Competent Authority since they have issued the Completion certificate. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension does not grant immunity from any violation of Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016, if committed during the period of lapse of validity of registration granted by Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab. The promoter is also directed to comply with all the terms and conditions mentioned in the various approvals granted by the Competent Authorities and prescribed obligations and duties under Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in letter and spirit without fail. This extension will not entitle the promoter to extend the date of possession under Clause 7.1 of the Agreement for Sale and u/s 18 of the RERD Act, 2016. ',2,0,'member.rera','2024-02-20 17:17:51.000','member.rera','2024-02-20 17:17:51.000'),(5105,150017,'member.rera','2024-02-20 17:18:59.000',1095,10274,'','FormE2023LDH0071','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd