5 15:50:22.106','','2024-04-05 15:50:22.106',0,'','Observations as per checklist.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:50:20.000','os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:50:20.000'),(5230,150006,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:50:36.000',1965,11142,'','FormE2024PTL0022','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-04-05 15:50:37.856','','2024-04-05 15:50:37.856',0,'','Observations as per checklist.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:50:36.000','os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:50:36.000'),(5231,150006,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:56:02.000',1215,10257,'','FormE2022SAS0062','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-04-05 15:56:03.793','','2024-04-05 15:56:03.793',0,'','The original validity of the registration of this project was up to 31.12.2022. Further, the extension for six months i.e. up to 30.06.2023 was also granted due to the COVID-19, as per Circular dated 28.10.2020. The promoter has provided copy of technical approval and building permit of building plans which was valid only for one year i.e. upto 30.07.2019. Now the current document uploaded is the Letter from MC, Kharar vide letter no. 738 dated 01.03.2024 which states that they have no objection to extend the validity of registration. Accordingly, the case is submitted for consideration /approval of extension U/s 6 for one year up to 29.06.2024.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:56:02.000','os.projects1','2024-04-05 15:56:02.000'),(5232,150006,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 16:21:28.000',1648,10788,'','FormE2023SAS0134','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-04-05 16:21:29.543','','2024-04-05 16:21:29.543',0,'','As per observations on 11.01.2024 it was informed to the promoter that the building plans were approved in year 2006 and after 18 years the project is still not completed as per the progress report submitted by the promoter. The builder is not serious in completing the project and has applied for extension after 11 months of lapse of registration. He claimed that the project has been delayed for no fault of his is not acceptable. They need to give a detailed plan how they plan to complete the project in time bound fashion supported with fund flow statement to ensure timely completion. Also please provide the building plans revalidated from the competent authority. The promoter has re-submitted the same documents without any explanation to non completion of the project after so many years. For further course of action it is submitted for comments. Submitted for consideration.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 16:21:28.000','os.projects1','2024-04-05 16:21:28.000'),(5233,150006,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 16:23:44.000',1607,10752,'','FormE2023SGR0082','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-04-05 16:23:45.887','','2024-04-05 16:23:45.887',0,'','As per observations on 11.01.2024 it was informed to the promoter that the License was issued on 01.08.2013, the promoter has failed to complete the project in more than 10 years. He has applied for renewal of registration in year 2023 with the authority after the expiry of license in 2019. In his explanatory note the promoter has state shortage of fund as reason for not being able to complete the project along with NOC from the pollution control board was valid for 16.07.2014. Please submit the renewed NOC from pollution control board. The promoter is required to submit the fund flow statements with the detailed time bound plan to ensure the completion of the project. The promoter has re-submitted the same documents without any explanation to non completion of the project after so many years. For further course of action it is submitted for comments. Submitted for consideration.',2,0,'os.projects1','2024-04-05 16:23:44.000','os.projects1','2024-04-05 16:23:44.000'),(5234,150006,'os.projects1',