e, the request of the applicant / promoter for grant of extension under Section 6 is submitted for consideration please. ',2,0,'excgen5','2024-06-12 13:12:26.000','excgen5','2024-06-12 13:12:26.000'),(5553,150006,'excgen5','2024-06-12 14:40:20.000',2149,11304,'','FormE2024SAS0023','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-06-12 14:40:20.183','','2024-06-12 14:40:20.183',0,'','Checklist prepared with observations',2,0,'excgen5','2024-06-12 14:40:20.000','excgen5','2024-06-12 14:40:20.000'),(5554,150014,'excgen5','2024-06-13 12:53:49.000',2198,11342,'','FormE2024SAS0045','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-06-13 12:53:49.507','','2024-06-13 12:53:49.507',0,'','Checklist prepared',2,0,'excgen5','2024-06-13 12:53:49.000','excgen5','2024-06-13 12:53:49.000'),(5555,150004,'999','2024-06-13 13:29:55.000',1262,10299,'999','FormE2024BTI0024','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-06-13 13:29:55.000','999','2024-06-13 13:29:55.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-06-13 13:29:55.000','sysadmin','2024-06-13 13:29:55.000'),(5556,150004,'999','2024-06-13 13:46:56.000',2014,11183,'999','FormE2024SAS0034','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-06-13 13:46:56.000','999','2024-06-13 13:46:56.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-06-13 13:46:56.000','sysadmin','2024-06-13 13:46:56.000'),(5557,150006,'excgen5','2024-06-14 10:46:47.000',2023,11194,'','FormE2023SAS0090','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-