oter has requested for extension under Section 6 for one year i.e. upto 30.06.2020. Now the promoter has submitted renewed License to Develop Colony from Bhatinda Development Authority Lic.no. LDC/2007/198 vides Letter No. BDA/Bhatinda/2023/6456 Dated 26.09.2023, the License to Develop Colony is now valid till 31.12.2023.   Now the applicant requested to extend his RERA Registration application under Section 6 of RERA Act till 30.06.2020. Accordingly, the matter is submitted for consideration/approval of extension in registration period of this project for one year up to 30.06.2020.',2,0,'excgen5','2024-07-30 14:33:22.000','excgen5','2024-07-30 14:33:22.000'),(5714,150011,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-30 15:40:42.000',1143,10156,'','FormE2019BTI1017','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-07-30 15:40:41.321','','2024-07-30 15:40:41.321',0,'','Please refer to the office note the promoter has submitted the development plan clearly highlighting the area which is complete and where the development is incomplete. The Licence is valid upto 31.12.2023 and extension is required upto 30.06.2020. Submitted for consideration please',2,0,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-30 15:40:42.000','ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-30 15:40:42.000'),(5715,150011,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-30 15:57:42.000',1082,10087,'','FormE2024LDH0049','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-07-30 15:57:41.930','','2024-07-30 15:57:41.930',0,'','Please refer to the office note above. The promoter was earlier granted extension U/s 6 for 5 months as the licence to develop colony was not valid was valid upto 05.05.2024. Now the extension u/s 6 can be granted upto 04.12.2024 i.e for 7 months only and the licence to develop is valid upto 05.05.2025. The promoter has clearly highlighted the areas which have been completed and areas where the work is in progress in the development plan. Case put up for consideration and approval u/s 6 please',2,0,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-30 15:57:42.000','ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-30 15:57:42.000'),(5716,150004,'999','2024-07-31 10:36:29.000',1509,10616,'999','FormE2023SAS0054','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2024-07-31 10:36:29.000','999','2024-07-31 10:36:29.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2024-07-31 10:36:29.000','sysadmin','2024-07-31 10:36:29.000'),(5717,150006,'excgen5','2024-07-31 10:48:54.000',1509,10616,'','FormE2023SAS0054','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-07-31 10:48:53.587','','2024-07-31 10:48:53.587',0,'','The original validity of this project Gulmohar City 1 is 30.08.2020  which was further extended automatically for six months in view of COVID-19 situation i.e. upto 28.02.2021.  The promoter has requested for extension under Section 6 for one year i.e. upto 28.02.2022. The promoter has submitted / uploaded the regularization certificate for an unauthorized colony of this project which was issued by Competent Authority cum Deputy Director Local Government Patiala, on 11.04.2014.  The applicant has also submitted the latest architect certificate and Indemnity bond accordingly, the case for extension under Section 6 Submitted for consideration and approval please.',2,0,'excgen5','2024-07-31 10:48:54.000','excgen5','2024-07-31 10:48:54.000'),(5718,150026,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-31 11:14:54.000',1509,10616,'','FormE2023SAS0054','','','Authority Desk','Application Return Back to Evaluation Team','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-07-31 11:14:53.759','','2024-07-31 11:14:53.759',0,'','Please check the validity of the Licence and resubmit',2,0,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-07-31 11:14:54.000','ManagerIT.rera