,'','FormE2024SAS0071','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2024-12-24 15:21:44.130','','2024-12-24 15:21:44.130',0,'','The original validity of the registration of this project is up to 31.12.2024. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested extension under section 6 of the Act for one year i.e. up to 31.12.2025. The promoter has submitted the copy of License to Develop Colony dated 24.03.2022 issued by the ADC (UD), SAS Nagar (Mohali) which is valid upto 23.03.2027. Further promoter has submitted the indemnity bond regarding GST for this project. Accordingly, the matter is submitted for consideration/approval of extension in registration period of this project upto 30.12.2025, under section 6 of the Act.',2,0,'excgen4','2024-12-24 15:21:43.000','excgen4','2024-12-24 15:21:43.000'),(6081,150011,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-12-26 15:35:12.000',1735,11288,'','FormE2024SAS0071','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-12-26 15:35:14.033','','2024-12-26 15:35:14.033',0,'','Please refer the office note. The original validity of the registration of this project is up to 31.12.2024. The promoter has requested for extension upto 30.12.2025.The License to Develop is valid upto 23.03.2027. Extention may be granted for 1 year upto 30.12.2025, under section 6 of the Act.',2,0,'ManagerIT.rera','2024-12-26 15:35:12.000','ManagerIT.rera','2024-12-26 15:35:12.000'),(6082,150017,'secyrera','2024-12-30 13:12:59.000',1735,11288,'','FormE2024SAS0071','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2024-12-30 13:13:02.749','','2024-12-30 13:13:02.749',0,'','Approved as proposed.',2,0,'secyrera','2024-12-30 13:12:59.000','secyrera','2024-12-30 13:12:59.000'),(6083,150001,'999','2024-12-31 14:13:32.000',2414,11559,'999','FormE2024BNL0083','Form-E Submitted (New Applicati