 of extension in registration period of this project upto 30.03.2026, under section 6 of the Act.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-03-25 10:04:32.000','excgen4','2025-03-25 10:04:32.000'),(6358,150006,'excgen4','2025-03-25 10:21:23.000',2604,11729,'','FormE2025SAS0006','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-03-25 10:21:23.494','','2025-03-25 10:21:23.494',0,'','The original validity of the registration of this project is upto 31.03.2025. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested extension under section 6 of the Act for one year i.e. up to 31.03.2026. The promoter/ applicant has submitted Building Permits along with NOC dated 03.02.2025 issued by EO, MC, Zirakpur . Further promoter has submitted the indemnity bond regarding GST for this project. Accordingly, the matter is submitted for consideration/approval of extension in registration period of this project upto 30.03.2026, under section 6 of the Act.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-03-25 10:21:23.000','excgen4','2025-03-25 10:21:23.000'),(6359,150004,'999','2025-03-25 10:24:02.000',1108,11128,'999','FormE2023SAS0135','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2025-03-25 10:24:02.000','999','2025-03-25 10:24:02.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-03-25 10:24:02.000','sysadmin','2025-03-25 10:24:02.000'),(6360,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-03-25 11:17:48.000',2002,11178,'','FormE2025SAS0014','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-25 11:17:48.181','','2025-03-25 11:17:48.181',0,'','Please refer to the office note the case is put up for extension u/s6. As per the architect certificate the development works are still pending, although the final regularization certificate has been issued. Submitted please',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-03-25 11:17:48.000','DirectorIT','2025-03-25 11:17:48.000'),(6361,150007,'DirectorIT','2025-03-25 13:03:00.000',1597,10714,'','FormE2023SAS0051','','','Authority Desk','In-Complete Application (Additional Information Sought by the Authority)','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-25 13:03:00.349','','2025-03-25 13:03:00.349',0,'','Please attend to the observations in the checklist',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-03-25 13:03:00.000','DirectorIT','2025-03-25 13:03:00.000'),(6362,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-03-25 13:12:34.000',2604,11729,'','FormE2025SAS0006','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-25 13:12:34.597','','2025-03-25 13:12:34.597',0,'','Please refer to the office note above, the construction work as per table A of the Architect is pending. NOC from the the EO Zirakpur has been provided as the project was approved based on the building permits. The status of NOC has been updated submitted for consideration please',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-03-25 13:12:34.000','DirectorIT','2025-03-25 13:12:34.000'),(6363,150004,'999','2025-03-25 14:01:34.000',1748,10900,'999','FormE2025PTL0019','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Re-Submitted with Modification','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2025-03-25 14:01:34.000','999','2025-03-25 14:01:34.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Re-Submitted (Modified Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-03-25 14:01:34.000','sysadmin','2025-03-25 14:01:34.000'),(6364,150017,'secyrera','2025-03-26 12:27:55.000',1689,10821,'','FormE2024BTI0005','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-26 12:27:56.457','','2025-03-26 12:27:56.457',0,'','I have seen the office note. The promoter has received the completion certificate vide Letter No. 1160/MTP dated 30.12.2024 issued by the competent authority -cum - Commissioner, MC, Bathinda.  As the project has been completed and the promoter is required to keep the registration valid till the date of completion, his application for extension u/s 6 is approved. The promoter, who is present in person, along with his Advocate Ms. Manisha Maggu, has informed that they have applied for extension and completion and the file is being dealt with separately. ',1,0,'secyrera','2025-03-26 12:27:55.000','secyrera','2025-03-26 12:27:55.000'),(6365,150026,'secyrera','2025-03-26 14:51:00.000',2273,11406,'','FormE2025SAS0003','','','Authority Desk','Application Return Back to Evaluation Team','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-26 14:51:01.548','','2025-03-26 14:51:01.548',0,'','The promoter has requested the extension for one year. The representative of the promoter Ms. Manisha Maggu, Advocate pointed out the promoter has applied for completion of the project. The same has  also been pointed in the explanatory note submitted by the promoter. Our office has submitted the proposal of 15 days. Please recheck, reexamine and resubmit. ',2,0,'secyrera','2025-03-26 14:51:00.000','secyrera','2025-03-26 14:51:00.000'),(6366,150017,'secyrera','2025-03-26 14:52:54.000',2604,11729,'','FormE2025SAS0006','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-26 14:52:55.304','','2025-03-26 14:52:55.304',0,'','Approved as proposed.',1,0,'secyrera','2025-03-26 14:52:54.000','secyrera','2025-03-26 14:52:54.000'),(6367,150017,'secyrera','2025-03-26 15:03:51.000',2002,11178,'','FormE2025SAS0014','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-26 15:03:52.581','','2025-03-26 15:03:52.581',0,'','Keeping in view of the regularisation certificate issued by the Competent Authority dated 26.05.2022 and the matter was discussed in the Authority meeting dated 05.02.2025 and the request of the promoter, the extension u/s 6 is approved. The promoter may be asked to submit the completion certificate separately.',1,0,'secyrera','2025-03-26 15:03:51.000','secyrera','2025-03-26 15:03:51.000'),(6368,150006,'excgen4','2025-03-28 10:48:58.000',2049,11217,'','FormE2025BTI0009','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-03-28 10:48:59.652','','2025-03-28 10:48:59.652',0,'','The initial validity of the registration of the project was upto 31.03.2023. Consequent upon lapse of registration, the promoter / applicant has further applied for extension u/s 6 for a period of one year i.e. upto 30.03.2024. In the present case, the applicant / promoter has submitted the copy of regularization certificate of unauthorized colony dated 21.07.2022 issued by ADC (UD), Bathinda. Accordingly, the request of the promoter for extension u/s 6 upto 30.03.2024 is submitted for consideration please.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-03-28 10:48:58.000','excgen4','2025-03-28 10:48:58.000'),(6369,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-03-28 11:33:17.000',2049,11217,'','FormE2025BTI0009','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-28 11:33:18.783','','2025-03-28 11:33:18.783',0,'','Please refer office note, the final regularization certificate has been issued by the ADC(UD), Bhatinda as per the Architect Certificate the development works are all complete case is submitted for approval of extension u/s 6 upto 30.3.2024',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-03-28 11:33:17.000','DirectorIT','2025-03-28 11:33:17.000'),(6370,150017,'secyrera','2025-03-28 14:30:06.000',2049,11217,'','FormE2025BTI0009','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-03-28 14:30:07.754','','2025-03-28 14:30:07.754',0,'','Approved as proposed. The case for completion be dealt with separately on the basis of letter dated 04.09.2024 issued by the ADC(UD).',1,0,'secyrera','2025-03-28 14:30:06.000','secyrera','2025-03-28 14:30:06.000');
