'Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-04-11 10:52:51.431','','2025-04-11 10:52:51.431',0,'','Applicant/ promoter was asked to submit NOC from ADC (UD) but promoter has submitted NOC from EO MC Nayagaon along with Affidavit stating that the project falls within the limits of MC Nayagaon. Further, The  project in question is  under litigation. The promoter/ applicant has submitted the  order of Honorable Supreme Court dated 19.03.2025 wherein statement of Advocate General for State of Punjab has been taken on record and the matter is now pending for 16.04.2025. It is pertinent to mention here that although in statement of Advocate General clarification regarding area of project is given but final order of Honorable Supreme Court has yet to come. The matter is submitted for consideration and further orders of the Authority please.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-04-11 10:52:50.000','excgen4','2025-04-11 10:52:50.000'),(6397,150006,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:27:17.000',1039,10135,'','FormE2023SAS0009','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-04-11 11:27:18.934','','2025-04-11 11:27:18.934',0,'','Promoter/applicant has submitted Occupancy Certificate along with Technical approval. It is pertinent to mention here that the promoter/ applicant was asked to submit NOC from Competent Authority till the date of Occupancy Certificate. Now, promoter has submitted that Competent Authority denied to issue NOC as OC has already been issued by them. Submitted for consideration and further orders of the Authority please.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:27:17.000','excgen4','2025-04-11 11:27:17.000'),(6398,150014,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:41:59.000',1748,10900,'','FormE2025PTL0019','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-04-11 11:42:00.192','','2025-04-11 11:42:00.192',0,'','Check list prepared with observations',2,0,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:41:59.000','excgen4','2025-04-11 11:41:59.000'),(6399,150006,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:45:51.000',1680,10859,'','FormE2023LDH0123','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-04-11 11:45:52.965','','2025-04-11 11:45:52.965',0,'','Check list prepared with observations',2,0,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:45:51.000','excgen4','2025-04-11 11:45:51.000'),(6400,150006,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:57:11.000',1799,11007,'','FormE2025SAS0018','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-04-11 11:57:12.207','','2025-04-11 11:57:12.207',0,'','The initial validity of the registration of this project was up to 30.09.2024. Further, the extension for six months i.e. up to 30.03.2025 was also granted due to the COVID-19, as per Circular dated 28.10.2020. The applicant in his explanatory note has requested extension under section 6 of the Act for one year. Now, promoter/ applicant has submitted Allotment letter dated 22.02.2019 along with copy of registry of the said project. Further promoter has submitted the indemnity bond regarding GST for this project. Accordingly, the matter is submitted for consideration/approval of extension in registration period of this project upto 29.03.2026, under section 6 of the Act.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-04-11 11:57:11.000','excgen4','2025-04-11 11:57:11.000'),(6401,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-04-11 13:08:56.000',1108,11128,'','FormE2023SAS0135','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-04-11 13:08:58.009','','2025-04-11 13:08:58.009',0,'','Please refer the office note above, the case is submitted for further directions. ',1,0,'DirectorIT','2025-04-11 13:08:56.000','DirectorIT','2025-04-11 13:08:56.000'),(6402,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-04-11 13:24:31.000',1799,11007,'','FormE2025SAS0018','','','Author