s, five (5) towers are complete and for two (2) towers, 95% work has been shown to be completed relating to installation of lift, fire fighting, equipment, electrical fittings in the common areas, etc. The case is submitted for consideration of extension under Section 6 and further orders to apply for extension under Section 8 and application for completion certificate.',2,0,'secyrera','2025-05-05 15:26:03.000','secyrera','2025-05-05 15:26:03.000'),(6424,150006,'excgen4','2025-05-05 16:00:17.000',2021,11190,'','FormE2025BNL0004','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-05-05 16:00:20.831','','2025-05-05 16:00:20.831',0,'','Remarks as Form-E Document',2,0,'excgen4','2025-05-05 16:00:17.000','excgen4','2025-05-05 16:00:17.000'),(6425,150001,'999','2025-05-05 16:55:16.000',1006,11556,'999','FormE2025SAS0025','Form-E Submitted (New Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Submitted','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2025-05-05 16:55:16.000','999','2025-05-05 16:55:16.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Submitted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-05-05 16:55:16.000','sysadmin','2025-05-05 16:55:16.000'),(6426,150014,'excgen4','2025-05-06 10:32:36.000',2127,11291,'','FormE2025SAS0022','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-05-06 10:32:36.740','','2025-05-06 10:32:36.740',0,'','Check list prepared with observations',2,0,'excgen4','2025-05-06 10:32:36.000','excgen4','2025-05-06 10:32:36.000'),(6427,150006,'excgen4','2025-05-06 10:43:02.000',1587,10753,'','FormE2024SAS0078','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-05-06 10:43:02.739','','2025-05-06 10:43:02.739',0,'','As per approval of Ld. Authority dated 02.05.2025 on file. The matter is hereby submitted for withdrawal please.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-05-06 10:4