e promoter has uploaded the copy of building plan.This project was registered offline and there is no change in the facts and documents since registration. Considering the fact that the period for which the extension is applied has already lapsed, it shall be prudent to facilitate further progress, development and completion of the project and in order to protect to the rights and interest of the allottees, the Authority took a lenient view and has decided to grant extension under section 6 of the RERD Act, 2016 upto 28.02.2023. The Authority has directed that the promoter should be asked to apply for further extension under the relevant provisions of the RERD Act, 2016 or to submit completion certificate of the project. \r\n\r\n',2,0,'excgen4','2025-07-16 11:42:29.000','excgen4','2025-07-16 11:42:29.000'),(6869,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:42:46.000',1760,10942,'','FormE2023LDH0083','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-07-16 11:42:46.983','','2025-07-16 11:42:46.983',0,'','May please see the e-notes submitted by the evaluation team. The application for registration of this project was discussed in the Authority meeting held on dated 11.07.2025. Forwarded for recording the decision please.\r\n',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:42:46.000','DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:42:46.000'),(6870,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:43:13.000',1563,10679,'','FormE2023SAS0088','','','Authority Desk','Review of extension form and evaluation team comments','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-07-16 11:43:14.436','','2025-07-16 11:43:14.436',0,'','May please see the e-notes submitted by the evaluation team. The application for registration of this project was discussed in the Authority meeting held on dated 11.07.2025. Forwarded for recording the decision please.\r\n',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:43:13.000','DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:43:13.000'),(6871,150011,'DirectorIT','2025-