the evaluation team. The application for registration of this project was discussed in the Authority meeting held on dated 11.07.2025. Forwarded for recording the decision please.\r\n',2,0,'DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:44:39.000','DirectorIT','2025-07-16 11:44:39.000'),(6875,150006,'excgen4','2025-07-16 11:46:07.000',1206,10225,'','FormE2023SAS0001','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Prepared','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2025-07-16 11:46:08.216','','2025-07-16 11:46:08.216',0,'','The application for extension u/s 6 of the RERD Act of this project was considered and approved by  the Authority in the meeting 11.07.2025. The initial RERA registration of this project was valid till 31.12.2021, which was further extended for a period of six months due to COVID-19 in view of the Circular of this Authority till 30.06.2022. Consequent upon lapse of registration, the applicant / promoter has filed the said extension application online on 04.01.2023 with the request to grant extension in the validity of registration upto 30.06.2023. The promoter has provided the copy of License to Develop Colony dated 09.05.2018, which was valid till 08.05.2023. However, the promoter has sought extension till 30.06.2023. As such, the extension can only be granted till the validity of the License to Develop Colony. The Authority, therefore, after due deliberations, and considering the best interest of the allottees and development of real estate sector has decided to grant extension under section 6 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 only upto 08.05.2023 i.e. till the validity of the License to Develop Colony. The Authority has further directed that the promoter should be asked to apply for further extension under the relevant provisions of the RERD Act, 2016 or to submit completion certificate of the project. ',2,0,'excgen4','2025-07-16 11:46:07.000','excgen4','2025-07-16 11:46:07.000'),(6876,150006,'excgen4','2025-07-16 11:49:18.000',1255,10691,'