sent case, the applicant / promoter has submitted the allotment letter issued by GMADA dated 02.09.2021. As per Clause 6 (III) of the said allotment letter, the allottee i.e. the promoter must have to construct one storey within 3 years from the date of possession and this period can be extended by GMADA in the manner and on payment of such fee as may be prescribed. It is important to highlight here that the promoter has already applied for Completion Certificate with the Competent Authority i.e. GMADA on 02.05.2025. The applicant for obtaining of Completion Certificate has also been uploaded / provided. In view of the above, the present application under section 6 seeking extension in validity of registration upto 31.08.2026 is submitted for consideration please.',2,0,'excgen4','2025-09-19 10:08:54.000','excgen4','2025-09-19 10:08:54.000'),(7380,150001,'999','2025-09-19 10:45:58.000',2078,11245,'999','FormE2025SAS0050','Form-E Submitted (New Application)','Form-E submiited by Promoter with RERA','Actor Anonymous','Form-E Submitted','Role Promoter','HelpDesk Level I','2025-09-19 10:45:58.000','999','2025-09-19 10:45:58.000',1,'In Process','Form-E Submitted (New Application)',2,0,'sysadmin','2025-09-19 10:45:58.000','sysadmin','2025-09-19 10:45:58.000'),(7381,150034,'DirectorIT','2025-09-19 11:16:17.000',2423,11563,'','FormE2025SAS0046','','','Authority Desk','Application CheckList Verified and Forward to Secretary RERA','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2025-09-19 11:16:19.488','','2025-09-19 11:16:19.488',0,'','The project is on the GMADA Allotted site which does not bear any validity period. The last date of installment is 23.08.2025. At the time of registration the promoter provided NOC for AAI, Consent to Establish from Pollution Control Board and Fire.  The applicant has stated that he has applied for completion of the project in May, 2025 and is requesting extension upto 31.08.2026. It is pertinent to mention that as per the architect certificate the 