egistration is valid upto 31.12.2025 with Covid 19 extension. The extension is applied upto 30.06.2027. The promoter has submitted License to Develop valid upto 16.05.2028. The promoter has submitted NOC of PSPCL and fire. Application PPCB, NOC regarding PSPCL, Drainage, Acknowledgement for fees regarding Forest Road Diversion, Amended EC and AAI (Exemption from MC Kharar) is provided. Further the promoter in is explanatory note stated that they have completed 77 percent of the project and shall apply for completion certificate after completing the remaining work.  As per the architect certificate about 77 percent of the work is complete .  Submitted for further orders and consideration, please',1,0,'DirectorIT','2026-05-06 17:33:39.000','DirectorIT','2026-05-06 17:33:39.000'),(8508,150014,'excgen4','2026-05-06 20:18:36.000',1321,10898,'','FormE2026SAS0012','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2026-05-06 20:18:37.554','','2026-05-06 20:18:37.554',0,'','Check list prepared with observations.',2,0,'excgen4','2026-05-06 20:18:36.000','excgen4','2026-05-06 20:18:36.000'),(8509,150014,'excgen4','2026-05-06 20:32:42.000',2692,11805,'','FormE2026LDH0014','','','Authority Desk','Evaluation of Project Land Details (Form-E) as per Standard Checklist','7b9d725a-b33c-4aba-934a-bee1ec13f684','','2026-05-06 20:32:43.707','','2026-05-06 20:32:43.707',0,'','Check list prepared with observations',2,0,'excgen4','2026-05-06 20:32:42.000','excgen4','2026-05-06 20:32:42.000'),(8510,150017,'secttrera','2026-05-07 12:30:07.000',2583,11693,'','FormE2025BTI0059','','','Authority Desk','Application Accepted for Extension of Registration','15ac7786-a35e-46a3-ae19-8befd003dcfd','','2026-05-07 12:30:08.281','','2026-05-07 12:30:08.281',0,'','ookid 2026',1,0,'secttrera','2026-05-07 12:30:07.000','secttrera','2026-05-07 12:30:07.000'),(8511,150017,'secttrera','2026-05-07 12:30:56.000',2262,11405,'